Tesla filed four new patents on AI chipmath that cut power use in cars while a $30 billion credit line funds the work. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 625. Two of the same inventors filed the base two softmax patent application. The filing remains an application only. It shows direction for future chip design rather than chip code. The patent focuses on base two softmax calculations. This approach aligns with hardware

