00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:47.340
The Lithium extraction patent relies on sodium trading places with loosely held Lithium.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:54.420
Spodumine and lipidolite appear only as contaminants in the clay tests. Hard rock ores require

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.140
