00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:08.460
Clay deposits hold lithium in a form that allows the swap at lower temperatures.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.360
Hard rock structures lock the element inside tight crystals.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:19.100
The softmax patent replaces E with 2 to suit hardware arithmetic inside vehicles.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.980
Every bit saved matters when inference runs on car chips.

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:25.480
The filing is still an application.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.540
The swap simplifies calculations the chip performs more readily.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:34.680
Vehicle-based AI workloads benefit from reduced power draw per operation.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.780
The patent builds on earlier softmax work from the same team.

